",\"createdBy\":\"s-createdby\",\"createdByType\":\"s-createdbytype\",\"lastModifiedAt\":\"2026-11-06T10:00:00Z\",\"lastModifiedBy\":\"s-lastmodifiedby\",\"lastModifiedByType\":\"s-lastmodifiedbytype\"},\"type\":\"s-type\"}]}")
  gv_note(f, "CALL ReplicationJobsClient.NewListPager")
  var pg = c.new_list_pager("id1/ x", "id2/ x", ReplicationJobsClientListOptions{filter: Some("s-filter")}) ?? e => fault("${e}")
  for page in [1, 2] {
    if !pg.more() {
      gv_note(f, "OUT page ${page}: no more")
      break
